HFI gen2, stage 1 at the top clock for decode order sessions (and,
with qcom_iris.low_latency=1, for decoder sessions up to 4096x2160),
and fewer bandwidth rescales.

 1/4 media: iris: count CABAC and per-macroblock cost in the decoder VSP clock
     Author: virtudude <virtudude@protonmail.com>
